        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "**Scope:** Traefik access logs (`traefik.traefik`, JSON on docker stdout) shipped by promtail to Loki. Only `/api/*` LeagueSphere traffic is analysed here.\n\n**Effective window (important):** Docker `local` log driver rotation keeps roughly the **current day** of container logs; Loki retention is 31d (`retention_period: 744h`) but cannot show what Docker already rotated. Treat this dashboard as a **~24h window**. Longer retention / recording rules are a follow-up proposal, not part of this dashboard.\n\n**Query conventions (copied from the Security dashboard):** stream `{job=\"docker\", container=\"traefik.traefik\"}`, structured-metadata filters `| path =~ \"\u2026\"`, `| user_agent =~ \"\u2026\"`, `| status =~ \"\u2026\"`. `ClientHost`, `Duration` (ns), `DownstreamContentSize`, `RouterName` are parsed at query time with `| json`. Healthchecks (`/health`, `/metrics`, `HEAD /`) are already dropped by promtail and excluded here.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "About this dashboard / effective window",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "id": 109
    },
